{"_note":"拾光物语 ch2 comic pages, same format as mobile/story-comics-ch1.json. Crops are [x,y,w,h] fractions of the 1536x1024 level image.","chapter":"shiguang-ch2","levels":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"第二天一早，阿福带小禾来到早餐街。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"滋啦——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，阿福带小禾来到早餐街。"}]},{"crop":[0,0.1758,0.2474,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"包子、油条、豆浆……整条街都是热气。"}]},{"crop":[0.4818,0.3906,0.1953,0.2344],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"小禾姐姐，你看天上！"}]},{"crop":[0.5729,0.0293,0.4167,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"早餐店……飘到天上去了？"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"那是福爷爷的店。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"早餐店原来的地方，只剩一块空地。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，早餐店原来的地方只剩一块空地。"}]},{"crop":[0.3516,0.1406,0.1693,0.2148],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"昨晚，我梦见开张那天了。"}]},{"crop":[0.3516,0.4199,0.2214,0.2148],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"嗅嗅……"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"蒸笼是空的，还留着一点面香。"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.2148,0.5013,0.376],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"那天的包子什么味儿……想不起来喽。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"蒸笼的热气，一级一级铺到了天上。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"呼——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，热气铺成了一级一级的台阶。"}]},{"crop":[0.4427,0.0391,0.2474,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"喵！"}]},{"crop":[0.7031,0.6836,0.1693,0.2344],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"小心呀——！"}]},{"crop":[0.1172,0.0586,0.4688,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"团子，等等我！"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"飘着的早餐店里，时间好像停住了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，飘着的早餐店里，时间好像停住了。"}]},{"crop":[0.2734,0.4395,0.4427,0.4395],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"菜谱碎成了一片片光。"}]},{"crop":[0.5339,0.332,0.2474,0.2734],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪！"}]},{"crop":[0.2474,0.0879,0.4036,0.3027],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这张菜谱……是奶奶的字！"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"把菜谱拼回来，店就能回家了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪嗒。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，最后一片拼了上去。"}]},{"crop":[0.4427,0.0586,0.1953,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"开张那天，有个扎辫子的姑娘来帮忙。"}]},{"crop":[0.625,0.0293,0.1953,0.3613],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“褶子捏够十八个，包子才会笑。”"}]},{"crop":[0.2604,0.3711,0.5078,0.3809],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"奶奶也在！她在教福爷爷包包子。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"天黑了，早餐街亮起一串灯笼。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，早餐店落回了老地方。"}]},{"crop":[0.4427,0.2441,0.2734,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"就是这个味儿！"}]},{"crop":[0.319,0.4395,0.1367,0.2441],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"啊呜！"}]},{"crop":[0.5339,0,0.4622,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"碎片们又飞起来了，飞向云上的邮局。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"奶奶的下一段回忆，在云上邮局。"}]}]}}]}